                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                        "entry_id": "7350f304-b52b-361c-bdbf-16f72ee6c14c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a belated manner; tardily."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9662ffa0-939e-4762-b151-d3c83c8fff0d",
                                "sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                                "text": "Bennett was belatedly sent off for a second yellow card after fouling Brahim Diaz in added time but there was no shame in Cardiff losing to a City side who have enjoyed similar dominance over far superior teams this season."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f219679b-a851-416d-b713-8b6187ec1f10",
                                "sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                                "text": "However, the Japanese battleships and cruisers now come to Chikumas aid, and, within ten minutes, the Roberts is knocked out of action, as the Japanese ships firing at her also belatedly' switch to high explosive, and, within minutes of this change, several massive holes are blasted into her side and she begins to sink."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d5544b1-ef45-4e25-883d-c128ef5a2e7d",
                                "sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                                "text": "Storm Charlie had raged throught [sic] the night and was unleashing further gusts on the morning that RAIL was due to inspect a vegetation management project in Kent. Bit by bit, the train timetable unravelled. A trip beginning at Bradford-on-Avon belatedly reached Bath, but that turned out to be journey's end."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d5d7a2d-8aad-4afe-9dbe-c79f549a3c14",
                        "source_entry_id": "7350f304-b52b-361c-bdbf-16f72ee6c14c",
                        "source_sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a belated manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "tardivement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tardivement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b94c04d0-2975-3c20-a3ab-81a7b06d0d8c",
                                        "entry_id": "509646d9-782a-37c0-b2f8-3fe0edd38586",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière tardive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "078991eb-825a-4398-b0ea-05c6035163e9",
                                                "sense_id": "b94c04d0-2975-3c20-a3ab-81a7b06d0d8c",
                                                "text": "Il apparaît assez tardivement, comme la plupart des hygrophores, préférant la fraîcheur des pluies automnales aux chaleurs de la fin de l'été."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "33a7dbaa-7d73-4dac-a9cc-49298beb0dac",
                        "source_entry_id": "7350f304-b52b-361c-bdbf-16f72ee6c14c",
                        "source_sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a belated manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "avec du retard",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16dd290d-8260-4f13-928a-8e4e290d8f71",
                        "source_entry_id": "7350f304-b52b-361c-bdbf-16f72ee6c14c",
                        "source_sense_id": "99be29e3-407a-3fd4-8451-b9cd742a6c8c",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a belated manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "en retard",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en retard",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fa80cf6-45c8-3d32-b108-7944d9dfb4b9",
                                        "entry_id": "43207593-6ac6-3f9f-accd-902551c69cb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Après le moment prévu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac36c2d7-48de-469d-84e5-2c8e815900b7",
                                                "sense_id": "1fa80cf6-45c8-3d32-b108-7944d9dfb4b9",
                                                "text": "Aussi, dès qu’il arrive, agace-t-il les demoiselles de comptoir, dont les yeux vifs attirent force chalands ; se gaudit au sein des parures, des fichus, de la mousseline façonnée par ces habiles ouvrières ; ou, plus souvent encore, avant de dîner, il sert une pratique, copie une page du journal ou porte chez l’huissier quelque effet en retard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71873d99-164a-4e35-ad73-6b2a5f3954c0",
                                                "sense_id": "1fa80cf6-45c8-3d32-b108-7944d9dfb4b9",
                                                "text": "« Madame vous fait dire qu’elle n’ira pas à la messe. Ne vous mettez pas en retard pour elle. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc184c68-ddfc-49f2-9bde-2529a2051228",
                                                "sense_id": "1fa80cf6-45c8-3d32-b108-7944d9dfb4b9",
                                                "text": "Si les Lisboètes sont arrivés en retard au stade Vélodrome à cause des embouteillages, ils n’ont pas trainé pour marquer, puisque Francisco Trincao a trompé Pau Lopez d’un enroulé du gauche avant même que la première minute soit écoulée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c2d3cb33-e602-40c1-a999-8a59ffdfc828",
                        "source_entry_id": "7350f304-b52b-361c-bdbf-16f72ee6c14c",
